The office scene is built from simple shapes (boxes, cylinders, spheres) in code. It has no model, texture or font files.

Hermes3D (MIT): the plan for this project suggests drawing ideas from the open source Hermes3D project. The build
environment could only reach npm, so no Hermes3D code or assets were fetched or copied. The idea we share with it is
the general one: a small low-poly office where each agent has a desk. If a later change borrows code or models from
Hermes3D, copy its MIT licence text here and name the files.
